                                                                                           Remediation


✅ 1. Server-Side Price Validation (Most Important)
Never trust client-side values
Fetch price only from database
Recalculate total on server

✅ 2. Use Product IDs, Not Prices
❌ Client sends price
✅ Client sends product_id → server fetches price

✅ 3. Protect APIs
Validate: price,quantity,discounts,coupons
Reject negative or decimal manipulation

✅ 4. Use Signed / Encrypted Tokens
HMAC or JWT-based order tokens
Prevent tampering of critical fields

✅ 5. Logging & Monitoring
Detect:Price mismatch attempts
       Repeated abnormal values
       Alert on fraud patterns
